WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.703
The customer email asks for missing information.

00:00:02.703 --> 00:00:06.949
The internal manager note reports the waiting status and responsible owner.

00:00:06.949 --> 00:00:11.968
Both preserve the same condition: the review period begins when complete information arrives.

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:19.304
A shorter version saying the estimate will be completed in two days changes the promise and must be corrected.
